  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive). Pattern: Xをもてなす.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {客|きゃく}をもてなす (to entertain guests)\n- {手料理|てりょうり}でもてなす (to treat with home cooking)\n- {心|こころ}を{込|こ}めてもてなす (to host wholeheartedly)\n- {温|あたた}かくもてなす (to give a warm welcome)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\nThe noun form おもてなし is widely known from the phrase 「おもてなしの{心|こころ}」 (the spirit of hospitality). おもてなし became internationally known through the 2013 Tokyo Olympics bid presentation.",
